            "detailed_description": "<h1>New DLC &quot;Steel Eagle - Cave mission&quot; is available now</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/header_DLC_Cave.png?t=1522914802\" /></span><br>In the newest DLC you will find 20 levels in the new scenery of caves with narrow corridors and <br><br>chambers. New difficulties have also been added in the form of a collision with slopes and rub on the <br><br>rocks. As in the basic version of the game, there are two difficulty modes: EASY and NORM.</p><br><h1>Try for free DEMO version of the game</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/header_FREE_DEMO.png?t=1522914802\" /></span><br>A cut-down version of the full game is now available to download as a Demo. Look for the „Download Demo” button on the Store page.<br><br>In the free demo of the game, players can know with the mechanics of the game. Two cut-down levels are available.<br><br>In the demo version there isn't available to unlock the limit to 60 FPS.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture1_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span><br><br>Steel Eagle is a reference to classic arcade top-down view shooters with a scrolled map. Lead the Steel Eagle safely through 20 levels, destroying as many enemies as possible on the way. At the end of each level there is a landing pad waiting for you, which allows you to move to the next level. Of course, the landing pad is guarded by enemies.<br>Once you reach the landing pad you will be able to exchange the points for additional force and strength of your “Steel Eagle”.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture2_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span><br><br>Main features:<br>- 20 different levels.<br>- simple vehicle development system, but giving the chance to try different development options.<br>- the ability to unlock the FPS if the standard speed of the game will be too slow for you (test how many frames will take your computer!).<br><br>Sit at the controls of the “Steel Eagle” and get the most points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture3_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture1_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span><br><br>Steel Eagle is a reference to classic arcade top-down view shooters with a scrolled map. Lead the Steel Eagle safely through 20 levels, destroying as many enemies as possible on the way. At the end of each level there is a landing pad waiting for you, which allows you to move to the next level. Of course, the landing pad is guarded by enemies.<br>Once you reach the landing pad you will be able to exchange the points for additional force and strength of your “Steel Eagle”.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture2_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span><br><br>Main features:<br>- 20 different levels.<br>- simple vehicle development system, but giving the chance to try different development options.<br>- the ability to unlock the FPS if the standard speed of the game will be too slow for you (test how many frames will take your computer!).<br><br>Sit at the controls of the “Steel Eagle” and get the most points.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://store.steampowered.com/gfxproxy/betagfx/apps/733750/extras/picture3_800x100.png?t=1517933467\" /></span>",
